             :intent "shown-result (eval.clj ~3858) and seon.repl (repl.clj:483) recognise a render refusal only by `:seon.render.value/root-description`, so the new declared `:seon.render.value/insufficient-floor-budget-error` would be refused by render-ai-data's contract. Test `:seon.error/at` instead (one line each)."
